# Keep the generated log fixture byte-identical on every platform.
#
# With core.autocrlf=true (the Git for Windows default) Git rewrites LF to CRLF
# on checkout. data/raw_logs.txt is produced by src/generate_logs.py with a
# fixed seed, so its checksum is part of how we verify the file is reproducible.
# Without this rule a fresh clone on Windows receives a different file (+1 byte
# per line) and re-running the generator reports all 10,000 lines as modified.
data/raw_logs.txt -text
